<title>POLAND: Polish grain prices rise, livestock down in Oct.</title>
<headline>Polish grain prices rise, livestock down in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement grain and milk prices rose in October while pork, livestock and cattle prices fell, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES		OCT	 SEPT	OCT 95</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  59.01     57.34    36.40</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 2.9	 1.6	5.3</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			62.1	65.8     40.5</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  39.24     36.94    22.59</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 6.2	 5.2	3.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			73.7	69.8     28.2</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.60	2.66     2.60</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		-2.2	 2.5	1.5</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			-0.2	 3.6     39.5</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.60	3.83     2.73</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		-5.8	13.1     -1.7</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			32.2	38.0     -2.1</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		    0.53	0.51     0.47</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 3.4	 1.8	4.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			11.6	13.3     56.2</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
